            {
                "entry_id": "af77672d-5507-3152-bee6-6e85c76a40d9",
                "word": "ancillaire",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5141b217-2e46-46a5-aacf-1cce9e5b0b99",
                        "entry_id": "af77672d-5507-3152-bee6-6e85c76a40d9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "ancillaires"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                        "entry_id": "af77672d-5507-3152-bee6-6e85c76a40d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a rapport aux servantes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d6284c8-90bd-45c6-a787-ad52f18759cb",
                                "sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                                "text": "Ces pittoresques études de géographie linguistique et de camaraderie ancillaire se poursuivirent chaque semaine dans la cuisine, sans que j'y prisse aucun plaisir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdb8b670-7e86-4efb-927a-ab0238f23cd1",
                                "sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                                "text": "On voit que la moralité des armateurs et des gros négociants n’était pas toujours irréprochable et que l’amour ancillaire avait, à Saint-Malo, de chauds pratiquants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b91d2d7-ba40-4082-997f-7684d49daf4c",
                                "sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                                "text": "Les relations qu'elle possédait dans le grand monde lui en faisaient connaître les dessous, et grâce à des complicités ancillaires, il ne lui était pas difficile de se procurer des lettres compromettantes pour s'en servir à son avantage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f3414fd-7b1a-41d4-8dfe-166073f6431a",
                                "sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                                "text": "En effet, si le jeune homme du peuple trouve à nouer, dès l’adolescence, des relations sexuelles avec les filles de son milieu, le jeune bourgeois se trouve presque condamné à l’initiation par une prostituée, puis à la pratique de l’amour vénal ou ancillaire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a99da569-cf1e-4422-a26e-6fbe40f9f9a4",
                                "sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                                "text": "— Pour une fois que je tiens un artiste de la Renaissance, je veux pas le paumer à cause d’une bévue ancillaire.\n— Une quoi ?\n— Une connerie de ta bonniche !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9956f718-fb8c-4d93-a785-c559954b92bc",
                                "sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                                "text": "D’où la proposition d’une primaire : parce qu’on ne peut pas délégitimer la gauche de rupture et la repousser dans une position ancillaire, autant la noyer dans un processus «unitaire» qui dissimulerait toute divergence programmatique."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12cf9cd9-d40a-3b37-a9f1-a5507a47a3bb",
                        "entry_id": "af77672d-5507-3152-bee6-6e85c76a40d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Annexe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fb5d9ff-b0c4-4b1b-afa7-8f4f1f9830fd",
                                "sense_id": "12cf9cd9-d40a-3b37-a9f1-a5507a47a3bb",
                                "text": "on nommoit opérations ancillaires toutes celles qui n’étoient en quelque ſorte que préparatoires, diſpoſantes, & qu'on confioit à des ſerviteurs, à des apprentifs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "089b44ae-5b27-3d29-a36f-67f6e7f4cdfa",
                        "entry_id": "af77672d-5507-3152-bee6-6e85c76a40d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Annexe, qui est nichée dans une autre étude, en parlant d’une étude clinique, greffée sur le protocole d’une autre étude."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d46d676-aac8-4543-a14a-70248a543226",
                        "source_entry_id": "af77672d-5507-3152-bee6-6e85c76a40d9",
                        "source_sense_id": "c79f2385-6fed-39be-9c53-1077028855cb",
                        "source_sense_description": "qui a rapport aux domestiques",
                        "target_lang_word": "menial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "menial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15cfbb12-014b-3efb-8379-99d07ad4bd0b",
                                        "entry_id": "040350d5-5b98-3cbb-879d-aabd8c7e7438",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to work normally performed by a servant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b60039f4-9e3f-4a2b-8a3e-6734def344c1",
                                                "sense_id": "15cfbb12-014b-3efb-8379-99d07ad4bd0b",
                                                "text": "She hung round him, watching his every look as if she grudged the veriest menial offices from the servants; and she almost scolded him for not eating, when he had done justice enough to the good things set before him to have satisfied even the cook herself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e6dabde-a71b-48a3-ab8e-3545f24d8c31",
                                                "sense_id": "15cfbb12-014b-3efb-8379-99d07ad4bd0b",
                                                "text": "She was not proposing to go out again, so he got her slippers and took off her boots. It delighted him to perform menial offices."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d64d048d-55e4-3bf4-b78f-1dabbe153103",
                                        "entry_id": "040350d5-5b98-3cbb-879d-aabd8c7e7438",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to unskilled work."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cd61fb4-5a5f-4c3b-a231-09adf18daa38",
                                                "sense_id": "d64d048d-55e4-3bf4-b78f-1dabbe153103",
                                                "text": "menial job"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3140765-3ebd-4055-922b-26d97926774a",
                                                "sense_id": "d64d048d-55e4-3bf4-b78f-1dabbe153103",
                                                "text": "Father Brown took the paper without a word, and obediently went to look for the coat; it was not the first menial work he had done in his life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1af390a2-e177-49c1-877a-b2975841892d",
                                                "sense_id": "d64d048d-55e4-3bf4-b78f-1dabbe153103",
                                                "text": "I didn't see how sweeping and scrubbing a building was any preparation for the trade of electrician; but I did know that in the books all the boys started with the most menial tasks and by making good ultimately won to the ownership of the whole concern."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f9c99be-e186-49bf-a6a6-10ecbf8c24c3",
                                                "sense_id": "d64d048d-55e4-3bf4-b78f-1dabbe153103",
                                                "text": "For instance, controlling for the above-mentioned variables, migrants to Tangerang or Samarinda (rather than Medan) have a significantly greater chance of getting a craft (as opposed to menial) job."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a385227-2521-3d63-ac87-f606d0d4e814",
                                        "entry_id": "040350d5-5b98-3cbb-879d-aabd8c7e7438",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Servile; low; mean."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2b74a5e-3de7-43a2-9e0f-7b0270957427",
                                                "sense_id": "7a385227-2521-3d63-ac87-f606d0d4e814",
                                                "text": "a menial wretch"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "menial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ece4fe41-6061-3b28-919c-dd4472e712a8",
                                        "entry_id": "a370a25f-f185-3cb7-809e-6bb7519f4624",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A servant, especially a domestic servant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "100fc4ec-0c05-41b5-9f52-2e559b9e4fb2",
                                                "sense_id": "ece4fe41-6061-3b28-919c-dd4472e712a8",
                                                "text": "“Nay, Dame Mary,” answered the Knight, “it is enough you desire such an attendant.—Yet I have never loved to nurse such useless menials—a lady's page—it may well suit the proud English dames to have a slender youth to bear their trains from bower to hall, fan them when they slumber, and touch the lute for them when they please to listen; […]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "407e3df6-73e6-47a9-a41f-34d07c0b6eb0",
                                                "sense_id": "ece4fe41-6061-3b28-919c-dd4472e712a8",
                                                "text": "But the young man was conscious, at the same moment, that it had ceased to be a matter of serious regret to him that the little American flirt should be “talked about” by low-minded menials."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7362964a-f2aa-4888-9387-4d7700e754a5",
                                                "sense_id": "ece4fe41-6061-3b28-919c-dd4472e712a8",
                                                "text": "Was this stupid system, so cruel, so crushing, and producing at the top such absurd results as flashy, insolent autos and silly palaces and overfed, overdressed women, and dogs in jeweled collars, and babies of wealth brought up by low menials—was this system really the best?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfcadb6a-fdac-4de0-9856-7c829eb2b935",
                                                "sense_id": "ece4fe41-6061-3b28-919c-dd4472e712a8",
                                                "text": "He told me that princes, jeds, and even jeddaks of the outer world, were among the menials who served the yellow race; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30e6eb02-0254-42c6-8d23-e11491a05bd6",
                                                "sense_id": "ece4fe41-6061-3b28-919c-dd4472e712a8",
                                                "text": "The world was awake to the 2nd of May, but Mayfair is not the world, and even the menials of Mayfair lie long abed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c6ed67a-82e3-3703-9838-727d1650ed83",
                                        "entry_id": "a370a25f-f185-3cb7-809e-6bb7519f4624",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who has a subservient nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "67363156-7d00-489b-a93e-497e85ed5772",
                        "source_entry_id": "af77672d-5507-3152-bee6-6e85c76a40d9",
